<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12989"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, April 19, 2005 - 7:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey, that WAS quick...I am asuming that there is so much evidence against him that is why he &#34;waived his rights&#34; - ??? <BR>Phoenix....Rocky...maybe it is the stuff confiscated in the shed?  the DNA? <BR>I sure would like to know the &#34;mystery motion&#34; <BR>Chow<!--/Text--></td></tr>
